Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 17:40:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the manuscript tools to the certified editor.

The HuManuScript-based editor can select and combine paragraphs, mark where dictation lands, change a block's kind in place, clear formatting including strike, pick a table size, and store an image caption apart from alt text. Headings offer remove-header versus delete, and drags name the landing gap.
